WEBVTT

00:11:30.153 --> 00:11:33.856
Now there's a lot of important messages
that I could highlight for you all.

00:11:33.890 --> 00:11:36.059
And trust me, I could go on forever

00:11:36.059 --> 00:11:38.261
about every little thing
that needs to be done

00:11:38.294 --> 00:11:39.896
in the fight for trans equality,

00:11:39.929 --> 00:11:41.064
but I'll spare you.

00:11:41.798 --> 00:11:45.068
What I want you all
to leave here today knowing

00:11:45.068 --> 00:11:46.669
is that you can be Leah.

00:11:47.303 --> 00:11:49.305
You have the power to make a difference

00:11:49.339 --> 00:11:50.540
in someone's life.

00:11:51.741 --> 00:11:52.909
Because you never know

00:11:52.942 --> 00:11:56.145
when a transgender person
is going to come into your life,

00:11:56.179 --> 00:11:59.315
you need to be prepared
and you need to be ready to help them.